\">Not always. I sleep five or six hours, that's not enough.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Il vaut mieux dormir au moins sept heures.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">It's better to sleep at least seven hours.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Vous avez raison. Je vais essayer de me coucher plus tôt.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">You're right. I'm going to try to go to bed earlier.</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">🧑‍🏫</span><br><b>Et le stress ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">And stress?</span></p><p style=\"margin:8px 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b>Je marche le soir, cela m'aide à me détendre.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I walk in the evening, it helps me relax.</span></p>","recordPrompt":null,"expectedText":null,"size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276168,"_nanoseconds":800000000}},{"id":"HKlZt5rlCzWaqeo2jOKw","level":"b1","lesson":11,"part":8,"type":"text","name":"b1-l11-p08-b1","partTitle":"À vous 1/4","transitionMode":"button","url":null,"imageUrl":null,"content":"<p style=\"margin:6px 0;\">🧑‍🏫 <b>Comment prenez-vous soin de votre santé ?</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">How do you look after your health?</span></p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;text-align:right;\"><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.8rem;\">You</span><br><b style=\"font-size:1.3rem;\">Je fais du sport deux fois par semaine et je mange assez équilibré.</b><br><span style=\"opacity:.7;font-size:.9rem;\">I do sport twice a week and I eat fairly balanced.</span></p>","recordPrompt":"À vous ! Dites votre réplique.","expectedText":"Je fais du sport deux fois par semaine et je mange assez équilibré.","size":null,"created":{"_seconds":1793276169,"_nanoseconds":2